WEBVTT

01:40.110 --> 01:42.940
[Fangs of Fortune]

01:43.160 --> 01:45.940
[Episode 25]

01:45.990 --> 01:47.090
Zhuo.

01:47.270 --> 01:47.870
Cloud…

01:48.870 --> 01:49.990
Cloud Light Sword.

01:50.009 --> 01:51.039
Zhuo.

02:04.790 --> 02:05.840
Zhuo!

02:07.350 --> 02:08.479
Where are you going?

02:08.889 --> 02:09.669
Zhuo.

02:20.490 --> 02:21.250
Freeze.

02:25.960 --> 02:27.560
So, I'll give you the ability

02:27.579 --> 02:29.440
to be immune to my One-Word Spell.

02:30.380 --> 02:30.980
Wen Xiao!

02:33.360 --> 02:34.200
Wen Xiao!

04:05.920 --> 04:06.980
Mr. Zhuo,

04:07.580 --> 04:08.470
you're awake.

04:10.340 --> 04:12.200
Why are you standing in the water?

04:12.730 --> 04:13.650
Mr. Zhuo?

04:50.150 --> 04:51.170
Mr. Zhuo.

05:05.150 --> 05:06.080
Ms. Pei,

05:06.550 --> 05:07.550
where is Mr. Zhuo?

05:08.080 --> 05:08.970
Stop him!

05:11.760 --> 05:13.830
Everyone's safe.

05:17.090 --> 05:19.260
Everyone's safe.

05:23.350 --> 05:25.780
It's you, Commander Zhuo from the Demon Hunting Bureau.

05:25.780 --> 05:27.730
You're out on a mission at this late hour.

05:27.730 --> 05:29.060
You're working so hard.

05:30.120 --> 05:31.050
Commander Zhuo,

05:31.360 --> 05:32.570
it's rainy and windy tonight.

05:32.570 --> 05:34.230
Be careful not to catch a cold.

06:13.560 --> 06:14.360
Mr. Zhuo!

06:16.930 --> 06:17.780
Don't stay here.

06:17.780 --> 06:18.450
Go!

06:28.440 --> 06:29.510
Mr. Zhuo!

06:29.750 --> 06:30.720
Mr. Zhuo!

06:30.970 --> 06:31.590
Zhuo!

06:37.480 --> 06:38.470
Ying Lei.

06:40.290 --> 06:41.090
Zhuo.

06:46.000 --> 06:46.750
Zhuo.

06:56.920 --> 06:57.780
Ms. Pei.

07:11.880 --> 07:13.600
Run your meridian system quietly,

07:13.600 --> 07:16.060
and your demonic energy will adjust itself.

07:16.380 --> 07:18.130
Stabilize your energy, remove dust,

07:18.130 --> 07:19.990
and let it flow through your body.

07:20.560 --> 07:22.750
This is the formula for circulating your demonic power.

07:22.750 --> 07:24.280
Control yourself now.

07:37.130 --> 07:38.150
Zhuo Yichen.

07:40.260 --> 07:42.060
Why am I here?

07:48.890 --> 07:49.860
Mr. Zhuo,

07:50.150 --> 07:51.409
you're finally awake.

08:02.100 --> 08:03.700
How long have I been in a coma?

08:05.910 --> 08:06.900
I only remember

08:08.300 --> 08:10.160
the Cloud Light Sword was broken.

08:10.600 --> 08:11.400
Then...

08:12.650 --> 08:13.670
Then I...

08:15.690 --> 08:16.870
You killed someone.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.600
I...

08:26.050 --> 08:27.000
killed someone?

08:36.840 --> 08:38.150
Zhao Yuanzhou,

08:38.330 --> 08:39.760
tell me

08:39.780 --> 08:41.210
what happened.

08:52.990 --> 08:53.590
Demon...

08:54.610 --> 08:55.580
Demonized?

08:59.520 --> 09:01.200
You tried to strangle Wen Xiao

09:03.030 --> 09:05.090
at the Demon Hunting Bureau just now.

09:05.900 --> 09:07.000
Wen Xiao.

09:09.910 --> 09:10.910
I killed Wen Xiao?

09:12.030 --> 09:13.100
She's fine.

09:14.730 --> 09:15.740
I saved her.

09:17.120 --> 09:18.750
Then, you hurt Ying Lei,

09:18.880 --> 09:20.880
ran out of the Demon Hunting Bureau,

09:21.000 --> 09:23.210
and attacked a night watchman just now.

09:45.320 --> 09:46.170
Zhuo!

09:46.770 --> 09:47.470
Zhuo!

09:49.690 --> 09:50.350
Zhuo!

10:01.760 --> 10:02.560
Zhuo!

10:12.910 --> 10:14.570
Don't you remember anything?

10:19.900 --> 10:21.550
Not at all.

10:27.930 --> 10:29.120
But I think

10:31.660 --> 10:33.250
I did do these things.

10:36.260 --> 10:36.930
I...

10:38.130 --> 10:39.790
I know this feeling.

10:43.120 --> 10:44.230
Every time

10:45.670 --> 10:47.800
I was controlled by malicious energy,

10:50.440 --> 10:52.040
I experienced this feeling.

11:01.760 --> 11:02.780
Commander Zhuo.

11:03.920 --> 11:05.420
You harmed a civilian.

11:06.040 --> 11:07.760
I have to do my job

11:08.340 --> 11:11.070
and put you in the Demon Hunting Bureau's prison.

11:11.800 --> 11:13.040
W-Wait.

11:13.530 --> 11:15.730
Mr. Zhuo may have attacked the goddess,

11:16.110 --> 11:17.590
but he definitely didn't kill

11:17.590 --> 11:18.800
that night watchman.

11:19.590 --> 11:20.380
Look.

11:20.470 --> 11:21.660
There's no blood

11:20.520 --> 11:24.970
[Righteous God of Virtue and Blessing]

11:21.690 --> 11:22.890
on his hands and body.

11:23.760 --> 11:25.090
It was raining heavily.

11:25.160 --> 11:26.550
Even if there was blood,

11:26.580 --> 11:28.780
it would have been washed away already.

11:29.920 --> 11:31.470
You were there just now.

11:31.670 --> 11:33.270
We saw it with our own eyes.

11:33.300 --> 11:34.240
Don't forget

11:34.260 --> 11:35.460
Ao Yin was there, too.

11:35.860 --> 11:37.620
I smelled sulfur just now.

11:37.640 --> 11:38.630
It must be her!

11:39.250 --> 11:41.410
Are you sure you smelled sulfur,

11:42.480 --> 11:44.450
and you're not helping Mr. Zhuo?

11:45.670 --> 11:47.840
I'm not helping him.

11:48.640 --> 11:50.680
I think I did smell sulfur.

11:50.860 --> 11:51.790
You think?

11:53.800 --> 11:55.080
Yes.

11:55.280 --> 11:56.300
I think I did.

11:57.470 --> 11:58.930
Even if there was a smell,

11:59.230 --> 12:00.550
it would have been washed away by the rain.

12:00.550 --> 12:01.070
I don't think

12:01.070 --> 12:02.670
Mr. Zhuo would kill someone!

12:09.360 --> 12:10.490
Great Demon!

12:12.410 --> 12:14.010
Great Demon, say something!

12:16.020 --> 12:16.820
I

12:18.940 --> 12:20.300
did see

12:22.610 --> 12:24.640
him try to strangle Wen Xiao.

12:33.010 --> 12:35.410
When I was controlled by malicious energy,

12:38.050 --> 12:39.640
I even killed

12:41.580 --> 12:42.640
Wen Xiao's master.

12:47.390 --> 12:48.250
Zhao Yuanzhou

12:48.290 --> 12:49.370
is right.

12:50.870 --> 12:53.190
I didn't even recognize Wen Xiao.

12:54.950 --> 12:56.490
What else is impossible?

12:59.140 --> 13:00.120
Mr. Zhuo.

13:01.680 --> 13:02.780
Ms. Pei.

13:04.830 --> 13:07.070
Don't let me kill anymore.

13:08.320 --> 13:09.880
Put me in prison.

13:52.200 --> 13:53.220
Don't worry.

13:57.960 --> 13:59.500
I will save you.

14:33.020 --> 14:33.980
Wen Xiao.

14:53.190 --> 14:54.510
The damn contract

14:55.970 --> 14:57.660
is still making me

14:58.190 --> 14:59.130
hurt.

15:08.270 --> 15:10.620
I saw it clearly last night.

15:10.640 --> 15:12.850
Zhuo Yichen from the Demon Hunting Bureau

15:12.850 --> 15:13.990
killed someone on the street.

15:13.990 --> 15:14.910
He was so cruel!

15:14.960 --> 15:16.170
Hand over Zhuo Yichen!

15:16.170 --> 15:16.790
Hand him over!

15:16.790 --> 15:17.320
Hand him over!

15:17.320 --> 15:17.910
Hand him over!

15:17.910 --> 15:18.910
You must give us an explanation today!

15:18.910 --> 15:19.390
Hand him over!

15:19.390 --> 15:20.540
You people from the Demon Hunting Bureau

15:20.540 --> 15:21.940
can do whatever you want?

15:22.390 --> 15:23.710
A man who kills must pay with his life!

15:23.710 --> 15:25.280
How can you be so unreasonable?

15:25.280 --> 15:27.290
You stay with demons

15:27.320 --> 15:28.670
all the time.

15:28.670 --> 15:29.910
Even though you are human,

15:29.910 --> 15:31.760
you've become as cruel as demons.

15:31.760 --> 15:33.280
Where is Zhuo Yichen?

15:33.300 --> 15:33.780
Enough.

15:34.230 --> 15:35.160
Get out.

15:35.180 --> 15:35.870
Do you hear that?

15:35.870 --> 15:36.950
Get...

15:37.760 --> 15:39.460
Hand over Zhuo Yichen!

15:39.620 --> 15:40.320
Hand him over!

15:40.320 --> 15:41.180
Hand him over!

15:41.200 --> 15:42.000
Hand him over!

15:42.000 --> 15:43.190
Hand him over!

15:43.220 --> 15:44.230
Hand him over!

15:44.910 --> 15:45.710
Hand him over!

15:45.720 --> 15:47.290
Hand him over!

15:47.320 --> 15:49.000
Hand over Zhuo Yichen!

15:49.110 --> 15:50.910
Hand him over!

15:51.660 --> 15:52.710
Hand him over!

15:52.780 --> 15:54.250
Hand him over!

16:01.450 --> 16:02.520
I have a question.

16:02.550 --> 16:04.550
Why did they only throw leaves at me?

16:08.620 --> 16:10.750
I have the most sensitive nose.

16:11.070 --> 16:12.230
Will I never be able

16:12.230 --> 16:13.360
to smell food again?

16:13.370 --> 16:14.110
No.

16:14.230 --> 16:15.910
I'll be in bad odor forever.

16:15.930 --> 16:17.790
That's not how the phrase is used.

16:18.230 --> 16:19.020
Goddess.

16:19.050 --> 16:19.850
You're awake.

16:20.510 --> 16:21.440
You're okay now?

16:22.910 --> 16:24.420
What happened outside just now?

16:24.420 --> 16:25.700
Why was it so noisy?

16:27.580 --> 16:28.950
What happened to you?

16:29.850 --> 16:31.310
Why didn't you fight back?

16:34.860 --> 16:36.310
I didn't dare fight back.

16:36.570 --> 16:37.830
I couldn't fight back.

16:43.210 --> 16:45.470
Why aren't the great demon and Zhuo here?

16:48.320 --> 16:49.320
Where did they go?

16:54.300 --> 16:55.190
Mr. Zhuo

16:56.410 --> 16:58.070
is imprisoned in the dungeon.

16:58.720 --> 16:59.750
The dungeon?

17:01.810 --> 17:02.710
Last night,

17:02.750 --> 17:05.210
Mr. Zhuo couldn't control his demonic power

17:05.599 --> 17:06.760
and hurt you.

17:19.270 --> 17:20.310
Besides,

17:20.920 --> 17:22.390
he went out

17:22.569 --> 17:24.770
and severely injured a night watchman.

17:25.670 --> 17:27.970
That's what she thinks.

17:28.310 --> 17:30.520
I don't think Mr. Zhuo did it.

17:33.790 --> 17:35.260
It's not

17:35.360 --> 17:36.600
up to you.

17:37.070 --> 17:38.470
We need evidence.

17:38.990 --> 17:40.510
You saw those villagers

17:41.160 --> 17:42.200
just now.

17:43.120 --> 17:45.190
We need to give them an explanation.

17:46.840 --> 17:48.580
If Mr. Zhuo really did it,

17:51.120 --> 17:53.380
he must be punished according to the law.

17:56.240 --> 17:58.190
The night watchman has woken up.

17:58.770 --> 18:00.380
He almost hurt his liver,

18:00.900 --> 18:02.860
but he barely survived.

18:05.870 --> 18:07.330
It's good that he's alive.

18:07.880 --> 18:08.860
It's good.

18:10.360 --> 18:11.890
At least no one died.

18:13.000 --> 18:14.230
Zhuo didn't do it,

18:15.150 --> 18:16.160
right?

18:18.890 --> 18:19.700
No, he didn't.

18:21.360 --> 18:22.540
That's great!

18:29.250 --> 18:31.810
Is there a way to prove Zhuo's innocence?

18:33.430 --> 18:36.090
I asked the night watchman detailed questions.

18:36.300 --> 18:37.820
Although the man last night

18:37.820 --> 18:40.220
looked exactly like Mr. Zhuo,

18:41.320 --> 18:43.230
he didn't have a hard-to-copy feature

18:43.230 --> 18:45.120
of Mr. Zhuo.

18:47.620 --> 18:48.530
What feature?

18:50.480 --> 18:53.230
The ice marks that appeared on Mr. Zhuo's skin

18:54.580 --> 18:55.590
last night.

18:57.050 --> 18:59.310
That person imitated Mr. Zhuo very well,

19:00.090 --> 19:02.650
but he didn't know Mr. Zhuo had been demonized

19:02.780 --> 19:05.710
and started to have blue ice marks on his neck and jaw.

19:12.310 --> 19:14.220
Mr. Zhuo's demonic feature

19:14.990 --> 19:16.830
proved his innocence.

19:17.700 --> 19:19.700
I don't know whether to cry or laugh.

19:19.940 --> 19:21.510
Maybe this is fate.

19:22.610 --> 19:24.110
It's a mixed blessing.

19:26.280 --> 19:27.350
So,

19:28.050 --> 19:29.890
can you release Zhuo now?

19:36.440 --> 19:39.190
Do you blame me for not trusting Zhuo

19:39.840 --> 19:42.440
and insisting on locking him up in the dungeon?

19:44.230 --> 19:46.230
Ms. Pei, do you consider us friends?

19:47.140 --> 19:48.340
Of course.

19:50.490 --> 19:52.480
You are my best friends.

19:57.240 --> 19:58.300
Don't you blame me?

20:02.900 --> 20:04.440
I admire you

20:04.860 --> 20:06.940
because you are fair and selfless.

20:07.800 --> 20:10.200
Back then, to protect the people of Tiandu,

20:10.890 --> 20:12.310
you chose to cut off

20:12.310 --> 20:14.390
your blood bond with your brother.

20:16.170 --> 20:18.420
You chose to suffer alone

20:19.230 --> 20:20.620
and uphold

20:21.050 --> 20:23.270
the law and justice.

20:24.360 --> 20:26.470
Actually, by doing this,

20:26.640 --> 20:29.040
you protected not only the people of Tiandu

20:29.630 --> 20:31.090
but also Zhuo.

20:41.160 --> 20:43.200
You're really a good friend.

20:45.740 --> 20:46.920
Now,

20:47.790 --> 20:49.660
let's go pick up another friend.

20:52.250 --> 20:53.050
Okay.

21:42.920 --> 21:44.060
Wen Xiao.

21:49.070 --> 21:49.870
I'm sorry.

21:59.020 --> 21:59.990
Zhuo.

22:01.860 --> 22:03.640
You don't have to say sorry.

22:04.210 --> 22:06.610
You were just controlled by demonic power,

22:06.900 --> 22:10.560
just like Zhao Yuanzhou was once controlled by malicious energy.

22:12.320 --> 22:13.120
Zhuo!

22:15.480 --> 22:16.510
Zhuo.

22:26.240 --> 22:29.440
We must go to Bingyi's forbidden area as soon as possible.

22:29.950 --> 22:31.290
Otherwise, Zhuo

22:31.840 --> 22:34.360
will be torn apart by demonic power.

22:39.390 --> 22:41.310
But we haven't caught Ao Yin.

22:41.720 --> 22:43.980
If we release Mr. Zhuo now,

22:44.420 --> 22:46.250
the people of Tiandu

22:46.600 --> 22:49.200
will no longer trust the Demon Hunting Bureau.

22:51.480 --> 22:53.550
Isn't that what Wen Zongyu wants?

23:15.750 --> 23:16.550
Sir,

23:17.810 --> 23:19.170
you were right.

23:19.200 --> 23:21.950
They came to Tianxiang Pavilion to look for Ao Yin.

23:21.950 --> 23:23.170
But why did Ao Yin

23:23.190 --> 23:24.540
kill that man?

23:24.810 --> 23:26.170
A poisoned monster

23:26.200 --> 23:29.030
can eat human livers to relieve the effects of the poison.

23:29.030 --> 23:30.310
Li Lun was poisoned by me.

23:30.310 --> 23:31.480
Without the antidote,

23:31.480 --> 23:33.130
he can only eat human livers

23:33.210 --> 23:35.340
to temporarily suppress the poison's effects.

23:35.340 --> 23:37.400
But this is not a long-term solution.

23:37.460 --> 23:38.580
In the end,

23:39.120 --> 23:40.900
he will have to come to me.

23:44.150 --> 23:44.860
Go.

23:53.330 --> 23:54.850
Sir,

23:55.030 --> 23:56.350
you're a new friend.

23:57.080 --> 23:58.550
What new friend?

24:01.270 --> 24:02.910
Isn't this Commander Zhuo?

24:03.080 --> 24:04.210
What a coincidence!

24:04.300 --> 24:05.770
At this moment,

24:06.000 --> 24:07.930
you're still in the mood for entertainment.

24:07.930 --> 24:09.130
Commander Zhuo?

24:09.150 --> 24:11.440
Is he Zhuo Yichen from the Demon Hunting Bureau?

24:11.440 --> 24:12.590
It's so scary.

24:12.610 --> 24:13.610
Isn't he supposed to be in prison?

24:13.610 --> 24:15.690
Why was he released?

24:19.100 --> 24:20.990
He's wearing a cloak and doesn't want others to see his face.

24:20.990 --> 24:22.030
He's suspicious.

24:25.950 --> 24:27.130
What do you want?

24:27.910 --> 24:29.190
What Commander Zhuo?

24:29.260 --> 24:30.900
He is that demon!

24:30.940 --> 24:32.650
A demon who killed someone!

24:34.630 --> 24:36.620
Will he eat us?

24:37.050 --> 24:38.050
So scary.

24:39.030 --> 24:41.950
I told you people from the Demon Hunting Bureau are scary.

24:41.950 --> 24:44.070
They stay with demons all the time

24:44.210 --> 24:45.550
and always help them.

24:45.570 --> 24:46.250
Look.

24:46.590 --> 24:48.190
He's become a demon himself.

24:48.360 --> 24:49.370
Evil creature!

24:50.230 --> 24:51.760
What are you talking about?

24:54.540 --> 24:55.110
Evil creature.

24:55.110 --> 24:56.370
Scourge.

25:17.940 --> 25:20.200
If staying with demons makes one a demon,

25:20.610 --> 25:22.810
are you pig demons

25:23.400 --> 25:24.860
since you eat pigs and sheep every day?

25:24.860 --> 25:25.750
That's right.

25:27.000 --> 25:29.370
Do you want to know what a real evil creature is?

25:29.370 --> 25:29.950
What?

25:29.980 --> 25:31.740
Don't push it.

25:31.900 --> 25:33.030
Do you want to fight?

25:33.630 --> 25:34.850
Don't forget

25:35.070 --> 25:37.160
you're responsible for protecting the people.

25:37.160 --> 25:38.790
We don't pay taxes

25:38.790 --> 25:39.350
to support

25:39.350 --> 25:42.210
you people who can't distinguish right from wrong.

25:43.530 --> 25:45.200
It's true that we should protect the people.

25:45.200 --> 25:47.390
But when there's someone who can't tell right from wrong,

25:47.390 --> 25:49.000
we can't stand by and do nothing.

25:49.000 --> 25:50.370
Someone who can't tell right from wrong?

25:50.370 --> 25:51.920
I can't tell right from wrong?

25:51.920 --> 25:52.620
What does she mean?

25:52.620 --> 25:53.800
Isn't he a demon?

25:53.830 --> 25:55.700
Isn't he a demon?

26:02.400 --> 26:04.030
Isn't he a demon?

26:13.170 --> 26:14.570
What are you doing?

26:14.670 --> 26:15.720
Go away!

26:16.770 --> 26:18.340
Don't come any closer!

27:36.270 --> 27:37.500
Who did this?

27:37.590 --> 27:38.540
Come out!

27:38.590 --> 27:39.380
Move!

27:39.540 --> 27:40.560
He is a demon.

27:40.590 --> 27:41.610
So what if I threw an egg at him?

27:41.610 --> 27:42.810
Demons deserve this.

27:49.850 --> 27:51.270
Don't go too far,

27:51.270 --> 27:52.910
or we'll fight back!

28:10.270 --> 28:11.240
So many demons.

28:11.260 --> 28:12.480
I hate demons the most.

28:12.480 --> 28:13.000
Demon.

28:13.020 --> 28:15.630
The one with white hair must be a demon, too!

28:16.550 --> 28:17.950
The evidence is solid.

28:17.980 --> 28:19.300
Look.

28:19.340 --> 28:20.620
Are they demons?

28:21.410 --> 28:23.060
Are they demons?

28:23.870 --> 28:25.260
Are they demons?

28:38.860 --> 28:39.960
Zhao Yuanzhou,

28:39.980 --> 28:41.000
don't act rashly.

28:41.670 --> 28:43.010
Pei Sijing,

28:43.500 --> 28:44.390
step aside!

28:50.450 --> 28:51.600
Commander Zhuo.

28:52.130 --> 28:53.930
Is the person you are looking for

28:55.020 --> 28:56.350
over there?

29:02.960 --> 29:03.640
Ao Yin.

29:07.940 --> 29:08.740
Pei Sijing!

29:09.520 --> 29:10.300
Wen Xiao!

29:11.950 --> 29:12.810
Ying Lei,

29:13.010 --> 29:14.390
take Mr. Zhuo away.

29:17.210 --> 29:17.810
Let's go!

29:17.840 --> 29:18.930
Don't let them go!

29:19.520 --> 29:20.300
Don't go!

29:22.140 --> 29:22.970
Move!

29:22.990 --> 29:23.800
Move!

29:24.290 --> 29:25.290
Move!

29:25.550 --> 29:26.810
So what if he's a demon?

29:26.830 --> 29:28.070
Do demons deserve to die?

29:28.070 --> 29:29.470
Murderer!

29:29.490 --> 29:30.990
Murderer!

29:31.560 --> 29:36.800
♫Has anyone seen a bird with a broken tail?♫

29:37.030 --> 29:42.390
♫It uses starlight as its feathers♫

29:42.150 --> 29:43.100
Hit me!

29:43.210 --> 29:44.460
Hit me!

29:43.860 --> 29:48.980
♫Snowflakes on the corners of its eyes♫

29:49.380 --> 29:54.540
♫It doesn't cry for years♫

29:55.420 --> 29:58.110
♫The river flows east and west♫

29:58.420 --> 30:01.330
♫The moonlight shines north and south♫

30:01.810 --> 30:07.060
♫Lonely eyes can't make it through the dawn♫

30:07.650 --> 30:10.640
♫Time is quiet♫

30:11.410 --> 30:14.350
♫And noisy at the same time♫

30:14.570 --> 30:20.000
♫How many are the fallen flowers?♫

30:21.890 --> 30:27.250
♫I'm going home♫

31:05.660 --> 31:06.470
It's you.

31:08.290 --> 31:09.230
It's me.

31:12.360 --> 31:13.480
What?

31:13.660 --> 31:15.540
You're not going to kill me now?

31:17.070 --> 31:18.800
Now, I'm a demon, too.

31:19.700 --> 31:21.160
I have no right to kill you.

31:23.280 --> 31:24.380
I should

31:25.640 --> 31:27.560
kill myself.

31:27.840 --> 31:28.790
Do you know

31:28.810 --> 31:29.820
what Zhu Yan

31:29.990 --> 31:31.790
hates the most?

31:34.540 --> 31:36.300
He hates demons who kill humans

31:38.470 --> 31:40.080
the most.

31:50.680 --> 31:52.410
You planned this,

31:53.640 --> 31:54.400
didn't you?

31:55.890 --> 31:56.790
You framed me

31:58.560 --> 32:00.480
and made people despise me.

32:03.670 --> 32:05.480
Do you understand now?

32:10.110 --> 32:12.110
What do you expect me to understand?

32:12.620 --> 32:13.810
Me.

32:27.330 --> 32:28.530
You

32:29.680 --> 32:31.390
must have felt it, too.

32:33.140 --> 32:34.570
Being despised

32:34.590 --> 32:37.090
by ignorant and weak insects.

32:37.710 --> 32:39.490
They despised you,

32:40.270 --> 32:41.740
trampled on you,

32:42.210 --> 32:43.340
and cursed you

32:44.780 --> 32:47.970
just because you don't belong to the same race as them.

32:48.570 --> 32:50.550
How did it feel?

32:51.550 --> 32:53.570
Don't you hate them?

32:54.370 --> 32:55.830
Don't you feel aggrieved?

32:57.440 --> 32:59.750
What people despise are not demons

33:03.090 --> 33:05.140
but cruel and cold-blooded demons

33:05.910 --> 33:08.020
who kill countless people.

33:09.000 --> 33:12.410
People hate sinners who bring bloodshed.

33:12.800 --> 33:14.690
You're not a sinner,

33:15.400 --> 33:17.300
but they still hate you.

33:22.530 --> 33:23.220
They...

33:24.620 --> 33:26.860
They just don't know the truth.

33:28.070 --> 33:29.100
Really?

33:31.790 --> 33:34.040
When people knock down a divine statue

33:34.430 --> 33:35.840
and trample

33:36.080 --> 33:37.520
and spit on it,

33:38.900 --> 33:42.430
they never get it up and kneel before it to worship it again.

33:43.620 --> 33:45.460
That's because this statue

33:45.790 --> 33:47.430
has reflected

33:47.460 --> 33:49.870
their evil thoughts.

33:51.100 --> 33:52.590
They hit

33:53.160 --> 33:54.380
and insulted you

33:54.400 --> 33:57.110
just to vent their evil thoughts.

33:57.990 --> 34:00.330
Become a demon completely.

34:01.170 --> 34:02.660
What are you waiting for?

34:14.639 --> 34:16.840
You've turned into a demon from a human.

34:18.370 --> 34:20.830
It's hard for you to stay in the mortal world.

34:22.949 --> 34:25.449
But since you've killed so many demons,

34:25.940 --> 34:29.110
you won't be accepted by the Wilderness.

34:30.440 --> 34:33.159
You are the real outcast.

34:34.670 --> 34:36.000
Isn't that ridiculous?

34:36.980 --> 34:38.510
Do you feel lonely?

34:39.070 --> 34:40.560
Do you feel desperate?

34:42.600 --> 34:44.590
They don't want to play with me.

34:46.300 --> 34:47.100
Brother,

34:48.139 --> 34:49.560
have I

34:50.300 --> 34:51.179
made myself

34:51.219 --> 34:53.030
an outcast?

34:56.350 --> 34:58.520
I've seen too many demons.

35:00.670 --> 35:02.570
They were just like you tonight,

35:04.550 --> 35:07.270
being cursed harshly

35:08.290 --> 35:10.350
and hit violently.

35:12.000 --> 35:16.330
Wine cups and rotten vegetable leaves were not the only things thrown at them.

35:17.790 --> 35:19.310
There were also blades

35:20.700 --> 35:21.720
and arrows.

35:24.190 --> 35:25.690
You're right.

35:27.590 --> 35:29.390
Those rotten vegetable leaves,

35:29.840 --> 35:30.980
insults,

35:31.470 --> 35:32.880
and smashing

35:35.490 --> 35:39.370
are just excuses to let evil intentions go unchecked.

35:42.090 --> 35:44.860
These excuses won't make you stronger.

35:50.400 --> 35:52.670
I don't want to be like you.

36:04.260 --> 36:06.800
You will never be like me.

36:07.700 --> 36:09.450
Because you're too cowardly.

36:10.650 --> 36:12.110
You're not strong enough.

36:12.710 --> 36:15.110
You are as cowardly as

36:17.530 --> 36:18.510
Zhao Yuanzhou.

37:07.610 --> 37:09.590
Do you know what you are like now?

37:13.150 --> 37:14.780
A mirror.

37:16.680 --> 37:17.720
When I see you,

37:19.180 --> 37:21.270
I see an abyss.

37:23.500 --> 37:25.140
An abyss has a bottom,

37:26.000 --> 37:28.060
but it's hard to tell a person's mind.

37:29.200 --> 37:30.240
A person's mind

37:30.960 --> 37:33.650
is the biggest abyss in the world.

37:34.330 --> 37:35.720
You're wrong.

37:36.480 --> 37:38.540
As long as I don't jump down,

37:38.560 --> 37:40.000
it's not an abyss.

37:41.610 --> 37:44.250
You just want to see me jump down.

37:45.470 --> 37:46.530
If I jump,

37:46.880 --> 37:47.960
I'll become you.

37:49.770 --> 37:51.630
You're going to be disappointed.

37:52.580 --> 37:54.200
We are not weak.

37:55.810 --> 37:57.850
We have kindness in our hearts.

37:58.570 --> 38:00.300
No matter how long the night is,

38:00.430 --> 38:02.380
it can't suppress dawn.

38:02.710 --> 38:04.340
Everything will pass.

38:05.880 --> 38:07.440
A little starlight,

38:07.750 --> 38:09.170
a candle flame,

38:09.440 --> 38:11.580
and a street lamp left on for travelers

38:12.000 --> 38:13.680
can all pierce the darkness

38:15.910 --> 38:17.000
and you.

38:25.880 --> 38:26.870
Zhuo Yichen!

38:35.680 --> 38:37.150
You are really pitiful.

38:39.990 --> 38:43.410
You are the loneliest person in the world.

38:44.480 --> 38:47.040
You just asked me if I understood you.

38:48.030 --> 38:49.410
Ask me again.

38:51.460 --> 38:52.660
I've asked you again.

38:54.230 --> 38:55.360
Give me your answer.

38:57.040 --> 38:59.110
I will never understand you.

39:00.380 --> 39:01.510
But now,

39:04.030 --> 39:05.630
I understand Zhao Yuanzhou.

39:20.910 --> 39:21.840
Zhuo Yichen!

39:34.810 --> 39:37.960
♫The trees and grass of the world sway with the wind♫

39:38.020 --> 39:41.300
♫Beneath the bodhi tree, dust gathers♫

39:43.240 --> 39:46.410
♫Who truly decides fate's design?♫

39:46.470 --> 39:49.620
♫Vividly painted in black and white♫

39:51.450 --> 39:54.550
♫It's water under the bridge♫

39:54.620 --> 39:57.740
♫The moon sheds her light on my heart♫

39:59.790 --> 40:02.850
♫The good old days are gone for good like that lantern in my dream♫

40:02.910 --> 40:06.470
♫See immortals enter Penglai♫
